            profilom&eacute;trie num&eacute;rique, avec &eacute;valuation photographique en aveugle.
          {%- else -%}
            Randomised controlled trial, 136 volunteers, 30 sessions. Collagen density measured by
            ultrasound and roughness by digital profilometry, with blinded photographic assessment.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">
          Wunsch A, Matuschka K. <cite>Photomed Laser Surg</cite> 2014;32(2):93&ndash;100.
