      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">{% if is_fr %}Performance{% else %}Performance{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Plus de r&eacute;p&eacute;titions, si la lumi&egrave;re pr&eacute;c&egrave;de l'effort{% else %}More repetitions, if the light comes first{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            M&eacute;ta-analyse de 13 essais randomis&eacute;s de qualit&eacute; m&eacute;thodologique
            suffisante. Gain moyen de 5,5 r&eacute;p&eacute;titions et de 4,1 secondes avant
            &eacute;puisement, obtenu surtout par une application <em>avant</em> l'exercice.
          {%- else -%}
            Meta-analysis of 13 randomised trials of sufficient methodological quality. Mean gain of 5.5
            repetitions and 4.1 seconds to exhaustion, obtained mainly by applying light <em>before</em>
            exercise.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">
          Leal-Junior ECP et al. <cite>Lasers Med Sci</cite> 2015;30(2):925&ndash;939.
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s10103-013-1465-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a>
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">{% if is_fr %}R&eacute;cup&eacute;ration{% else %}Recovery{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Cr&eacute;atine kinase mieux contenue apr&egrave;s l'effort{% else %}Creatine kinase better contained after exercise{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            M&eacute;ta-analyse de 14 &eacute;tudes sur le marqueur sanguin de dommage musculaire. Effet
            net sur l'exercice localis&eacute;, non concluant sur l'exercice g&eacute;n&eacute;ral &mdash;
            une nuance que la plupart des pages produit passent sous silence.
          {%- else -%}
            Meta-analysis of 14 studies on the blood marker of muscle damage. Clear effect for localised
            exercise, inconclusive for general exercise &mdash; a nuance most product pages leave out.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">
          Machado AF et al. <cite>Clin J Sport Med</cite> 2020;30(3):267&ndash;274.
