            definitive proof.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">
          Zhao J et al. <cite>J Athl Train</cite> 2012;47(6):673&ndash;678.
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.4085/1062-6050-47.6.08" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a>
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">{% if is_fr %}Articulations{% else %}Joints{% endif %}</span>
        <h3 class="ln-study__claim">{% if is_fr %}Meilleur que l'exercice seul, en compl&eacute;ment{% else %}Better than exercise alone, as an adjunct{% endif %}</h3>
        <p class="ln-study__detail">
          {%- if is_fr -%}
            M&eacute;ta-analyse de 10 essais randomis&eacute;s sur l'arthrose du genou, tous de bon score
