            s'ajoute &agrave; un programme d'exercices.
          {%- else -%}
            Meta-analysis of 10 randomised trials on knee osteoarthritis, all with good PEDro scores. Pain,
            stiffness and function improve when light is added to an exercise programme.
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
        <p class="ln-study__ref">
          Ahmad MA et al. <cite>Physiotherapy</cite> 2021;114:85&ndash;95.
          <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.physio.2021.03.011" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DOI</a>
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="ln-study ln-reveal">
        <span class="ln-study__tag">{% if is_fr %}M&eacute;canisme{% else %}Mechanism{% endif %}</span>
